content:
I just love this game. It is fun and very challenging.  In fact, I love it so much that I purchased “no ads” for $9.99. However, I am still seeing the same ads that I had to watch prior to my purchase.  I tap “play on” or “hint” and I have to watch ads just like I did before my purchase.  Needless to say, I am very unhappy and very disappointed.  Please refund my purchase or, better yet, fix this problem.

UPDATE;

I submitted this review a few hours ago and you did respond. However, I erroneously deleted your response. Would you please resend your response to me again?  I apologize for any inconvenience and would greatly appreciate hearing from you again. Thank you!
